Reading the Bus Pirate . . .
COMMAND: BUS_PIRATE {0x22 0x08 0x11 0x04}{0x23 r r}
READLINE: BUS_PIRATE WASTE
READLINE: BUS_PIRATE WASTE
READLINE: BUS_PIRATE WASTE
READLINE: BUS_PIRATE WASTE
READLINE: BUS_PIRATE WASTE
READLINE: BUS_PIRATE WASTE
READLINE: BUS_PIRATE WASTE
READLINE: BUS_PIRATE WASTE
READ: BUS_PIRATE WASTE RS_MSB WASTE WASTE WASTE RS_LSB
SET: RESULT = [%RS_MSB% * 256 + %RS_LSB%]
